COMMENT     The assembly wpBraSpea2.1 is based on 22x PacBio data and Arima2
            Hi-C data generated by the Aquatic Symbiosis Genomics Project
            (https://www.aquaticsymbiosisgenomics.org/). The assembly process
            included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly
            generation with Hifiasm, retained haplotig separation with
            purge_dups, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial
            genome was assembled using MitoHiFi and OATK. Finally, the primary
            assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal.
            Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been
            named in order of size. PacBio and Hi-C data were generated from
            different individuals.
